From: Valentin SAMSON <BEAVSN@BEA.local>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:11:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] GX: drop GX_CULL_ALL polygons instead of aborting

Super Mario Eclipse sets GX_CULL_ALL, which the GameCube honours by
culling every polygon (lines and points are never culled). WebGPU has no
such mode: the command processor now skips those draws, and a pipeline
asking for it (from an older pipeline cache) gets no culling.

